speechtext:
I am informed by the Departments of Energy, Mines and Resources and Industry, Trade and Commerce as follows;
1.	(a) and (b) The National Advisory Council on Petroleum has not existed since 1978.
2.	Number of meetings in (a) 1981 None, (b) 1980 None. However, meetings were held with many business groups including the Canadian Manufacturers' Association, Canadian Chamber of Commerce, Air Industries Association and the Business Council on National Issues during this period.
